{"seq":2,"slug":"installer-skill-cert-route","title":"安装工技能/认证与派单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/assembly-install-service/installer-skill-cert-route","wordCount":1821,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"安装工技能-认证与派单\">安装工技能/认证与派单</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>安装工不是一个可以用「距离最近」来分配的岗位。原因有两层：<strong>技能不可替代</strong>（会装板式衣柜的人不一定会接燃气管，会装洗衣机的人不一定能做制冷剂管路作业），<strong>资质受法律约束</strong>（某些作业在没有相应资质的人手里是违法的，不是「不专业」而已）。因此派单问题的本质不是资源分配问题，而是<strong>带资格约束的匹配问题</strong>：先求可行解的集合，再在其中优化距离与工时。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Task[安装工单] --&gt; Req[从品类推导技能与资质要求]&#10;  Req --&gt; Filter[候选集过滤: 证书有效 &amp; 技能匹配]&#10;  Filter --&gt; Eligible{候选集非空?}&#10;  Eligible --&gt;|否| Escalate[升级: 跨区调度/延后/外包]&#10;  Eligible --&gt;|是| Score[按距离/工时/熟客匹配打分]&#10;  Score --&gt; Assign[指派安装工]&#10;  Assign --&gt; Kit[同步备件与配件包清单]\">graph TD\n  Task[安装工单] --&gt; Req[从品类推导技能与资质要求]\n  Req --&gt; Filter[候选集过滤: 证书有效 &amp; 技能匹配]\n  Filter --&gt; Eligible{候选集非空?}\n  Eligible --&gt;|否| Escalate[升级: 跨区调度/延后/外包]\n  Eligible --&gt;|是| Score[按距离/工时/熟客匹配打分]\n  Score --&gt; Assign[指派安装工]\n  Assign --&gt; Kit[同步备件与配件包清单]</pre><h2 id=\"技能档案的建模\">技能档案的建模</h2><h3 id=\"技能是分级而不是布尔\">技能是分级而不是布尔</h3><p>把「会不会装」写成布尔值会丢掉关键信息：一个人可以「能独立完成标准安装」但「不能处理疑难（改装、非标墙体固定）」。因此技能应当是分级枚举，典型分为三档：<code>assist</code>（可在他人带领下参与）、<code>solo</code>（可独立完成标准安装）、<code>expert</code>（可处理非标与疑难）。派单时的最低要求由工单的复杂度决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"品类维度\">品类维度</h3><p>技能必须按品类细分，因为大件的安装难度分布在品类上差异极大。一个可用的品类分层与对应的资质要求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>典型作业</th>\n<th>额外资质要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>板式家具（衣柜、书桌）</td>\n<td>组装、上墙固定</td>\n<td>无（但上墙固定需按标准用防倾倒装置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软体家具（沙发、床垫）</td>\n<td>组装、就位</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大家电（冰箱、洗衣机）</td>\n<td>就位、接管、通电试运行</td>\n<td>涉水作业需按当地规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃气具（燃气灶、热水器）</td>\n<td>接口接驳</td>\n<td>燃气作业资质（属地法规要求）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空调 / 热泵</td>\n<td>制冷剂管路</td>\n<td>制冷剂处理资质（法定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健身器材</td>\n<td>组装、调校</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后两类的资质不是可选项，而是法定门槛。以美国的制冷剂作业为例，清洁空气法 Section 608 由 <a href=\"https://www.epa.gov/section608\">40 CFR Part 82 Subpart F</a> 实施，禁止在维修、保养、检修或处置空调与制冷设备时故意排放消耗臭氧层物质及其替代物（含 HFCs），并要求从事相关作业的技术人员取得认证；EPA 在 2024 年 10 月就 HFC 及其替代物的管理发布了最终规则。在欧盟，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=OJ:L_202400573\">Regulation (EU) 2024/573</a> 的 Article 4(7) 要求从事 Article 10(1)(a)–(c) 所列作业的自然人「shall be certified in accordance with Article 10」，从事相关安装、维护、检修或退役的法人也须认证；Article 7 还要求为每台设备建立记录，包含气体数量、检修日期与服务提供方的证书编号，气体供应商须记录购买方的证书编号。这些条文对系统的含义非常具体：<strong>证书编号必须是一个可对外提供的字段，且派单必须校验证书有效性</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"证书有效期\">证书有效期</h3><p>资质证书有有效期。因此技能档案里每一项资质都要带签发日与到期日，派单过滤的第一条就是「未过期」。这与第 1.2 篇里叉车操作员的三年复评要求是同一类约束（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/29/1910.178\">29 CFR 1910.178(l)</a> 明确要求至少每三年评估一次），只是对象不同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE installer_skill (&#10;  installer_id   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  skill_code     TEXT NOT NULL,           -- e.g. FURNITURE_FLAT_PACK&#10;  category       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  level          TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (level IN (&#39;assist&#39;,&#39;solo&#39;,&#39;expert&#39;)),&#10;  certified      BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  cert_number    TEXT,&#10;  cert_issued_on DATE,&#10;  cert_expires_on DATE,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (installer_id, skill_code)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE install_task_requirement (&#10;  task_id        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  skill_code     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  min_level      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  requires_cert  BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (task_id, skill_code)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> installer_skill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  installer_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  skill_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- e.g. FURNITURE_FLAT_PACK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'solo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expert'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certified      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cert_number    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cert_issued_on </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cert_expires_on </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (installer_id, skill_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> install_task_requirement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  skill_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  min_level      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  requires_cert  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (task_id, skill_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>requires_cert</code> 与 <code>min_level</code> 分开是刻意的：一个有 expert 技能但证书过期的人，能通过 <code>min_level</code> 但过不了 <code>requires_cert</code>。把两个条件混在一个字段里，就会出现「技术最好的师傅被排去做他证书已过期的作业」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派单的匹配逻辑\">派单的匹配逻辑</h2><h3 id=\"两阶段-先可行-再最优\">两阶段：先可行，再最优</h3><p>派单必须严格两阶段，顺序不能反。第一阶段用 SQL 求可行集：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT i.installer_id&#10;FROM installer_skill i&#10;JOIN install_task_requirement r&#10;  ON r.skill_code = i.skill_code&#10;WHERE r.task_id = :task_id&#10;  AND i.level_rank &gt;= r.min_level_rank&#10;  AND (NOT r.requires_cert OR (i.certified AND i.cert_expires_on &gt; CURRENT_DATE))&#10;GROUP BY i.installer_id&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) = (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM install_task_requirement WHERE task_id = :task_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">installer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> installer_skill i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> install_task_requirement r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">skill_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">skill_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :task_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">level_rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min_level_rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">requires_cert</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">certified</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cert_expires_on</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">installer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> install_task_requirement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :task_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>HAVING COUNT(*) = 需求条数</code> 这一句是整段的关键：一个工单可能同时要求多个技能，必须全部满足。漏掉这个条件会选出「只满足一半要求」的师傅，而这正是现场返工最常见的来源。第二阶段才在可行集里按距离、当前工时余量、历史成功率打分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"技能不匹配的升级路径\">技能不匹配的升级路径</h3><p>候选集为空时，必须有明确的升级路径，而不是让系统随便选一个：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>升级手段</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>放宽时间窗</td>\n<td>延迟交付</td>\n<td>客户可接受延迟时首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨区调度</td>\n<td>行驶成本</td>\n<td>相邻区域有持证人员时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外包持证服务商</td>\n<td>毛利下降</td>\n<td>长尾品类、低频高资质要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双人组合（一人持证 + 一人协助）</td>\n<td>人力成本</td>\n<td>有持证人员但工时不足时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「双人组合」这个选项值得特别说明：法定认证要求通常针对<strong>实施该作业的人</strong>，因此持证人员负责关键步骤、助手负责搬运与辅助是被允许的常见做法（这也是第 2.1 篇里双人班组编制的另一种用途）。但它的合法性取决于具体法域与具体作业，不是通用规则，落地前需要逐个法域确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派单约束与安全装置的强制项\">派单约束与安全装置的强制项</h2><h3 id=\"防倾倒装置的强制安装\">防倾倒装置的强制安装</h3><p>家具安装里有一类作业不是「客户可选」而是「必须做」：衣物收纳柜的防倾倒装置。美国针对这类产品有强制性规则，成立于 2022 年的 STURDY Act 编在 <a href=\"https://www.cpsc.gov/Business--Manufacturing/Business-Education/Business-Guidance/Clothing-Storage-Units\">15 U.S.C. § 2056f</a>，CPSC 的最终规则发布于 88 FR 28403 并编入 16 CFR part 1261，通过引用采纳 ASTM F2057-23，适用于 2023 年 9 月 1 日之后制造的受覆盖产品；规则要求随产品提供符合 ASTM F3096 的防倾倒装置。这个规定的工程含义是：<strong>「未安装防倾倒装置」必须是一个不合格的验收结果</strong>，而不是一个可勾选的建议项。它应当出现在第 3.3 篇（<a href=\"../assembly-install-service/install-quality-verify-signoff\">安装质检与客户签收</a>）的验收检查点里，作为一个不通过即返工的硬项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"现场条件对派单的反馈\">现场条件对派单的反馈</h3><p>派单不仅要匹配人，还要把第 2.2 篇的可达性档案里的作业方式传给师傅：需要走楼梯、需要拆件、需要吊装的信息必须在工单上下发，而不是让师傅到现场再发现。一个带完整上下文的工单至少包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;task_id&quot;: &quot;IT-2026-1005-8842&quot;,&#10;  &quot;required_skills&quot;: [{ &quot;skill_code&quot;: &quot;FURNITURE_FLAT_PACK&quot;, &quot;min_level&quot;: &quot;solo&quot;, &quot;requires_cert&quot;: false }],&#10;  &quot;site_context&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;floor_level&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;elevator&quot;: { &quot;present&quot;: false },&#10;    &quot;stairs_flight_count&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;stair_turn_width_cm&quot;: 95,&#10;    &quot;door_clear_width_cm&quot;: 82,&#10;    &quot;parking_distance_m&quot;: 45,&#10;    &quot;lift_mode&quot;: &quot;two_person&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;physical_checks&quot;: [&quot;anti_tip_device_required&quot;, &quot;wall_anchor_type_check&quot;],&#10;  &quot;kit_ref&quot;: &quot;KIT-WARDROBE-V3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;van_spares_expected&quot;: [&quot;HINGE-KIT-EURO-STD&quot;, &quot;ANCHOR-M8-ASSORTED&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"task_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"IT-2026-1005-8842\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"required_skills\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"skill_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FURNITURE_FLAT_PACK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"solo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requires_cert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"site_context\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"floor_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"elevator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"present\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stairs_flight_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stair_turn_width_cm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"door_clear_width_cm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">82</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"parking_distance_m\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lift_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"two_person\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"physical_checks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"anti_tip_device_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"wall_anchor_type_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"kit_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KIT-WARDROBE-V3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"van_spares_expected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HINGE-KIT-EURO-STD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ANCHOR-M8-ASSORTED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>van_spares_expected</code> 把第 1.3 篇的随车备件清单接到具体工单上：师傅出发前按这份清单点料，是压缩二次上门率最便宜的手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>派单是带资格约束的匹配问题，必须先求可行集再优化，不能把技能当作可忽略的打分项。</li>\n<li>技能按品类细分且分级（assist/solo/expert），资质证书带编号与有效期；<code>requires_cert</code> 与 <code>min_level</code> 必须是独立条件。</li>\n<li>制冷剂与燃气类作业是法定门槛：美国 40 CFR Part 82 Subpart F 与欧盟 Regulation (EU) 2024/573 都要求认证并要求记录证书编号，因此证书编号是可对外提供的字段。</li>\n<li>多技能工单的可行集判定必须要求全部技能满足（<code>HAVING COUNT(*) = 需求条数</code>），漏掉即现场返工。</li>\n<li>候选集为空时走显式升级路径（放宽时间窗 / 跨区 / 外包 / 双人组合）；防倾倒装置按 16 CFR part 1261 与 ASTM F2057-23 是强制项，不可降级为建议。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安装工技能/认证与派单","id":"安装工技能-认证与派单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"技能档案的建模","id":"技能档案的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"技能是分级而不是布尔","id":"技能是分级而不是布尔"},{"level":3,"text":"品类维度","id":"品类维度"},{"level":3,"text":"证书有效期","id":"证书有效期"},{"level":2,"text":"派单的匹配逻辑","id":"派单的匹配逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"两阶段：先可行，再最优","id":"两阶段-先可行-再最优"},{"level":3,"text":"技能不匹配的升级路径","id":"技能不匹配的升级路径"},{"level":2,"text":"派单约束与安全装置的强制项","id":"派单约束与安全装置的强制项"},{"level":3,"text":"防倾倒装置的强制安装","id":"防倾倒装置的强制安装"},{"level":3,"text":"现场条件对派单的反馈","id":"现场条件对派单的反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开箱、组装与安装作业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/assembly-install-service/unbox-assembly-install"},"next":{"title":"安装质检与客户签收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/assembly-install-service/install-quality-verify-signoff"}}